     3	## Round 1 (v1, 2026-11-17)
     4	
     5	- **Codex:** NOT READY, 5 points. **Claude reviewer:** NOT READY, 5 changes.
     6	- **Taught:**
     7	  - I wrote the plan from memory of the launchers, not from their code. Four launch blockers would each have stopped or skewed a paid run:
     8	    - Step 1 stopping at 300 calls;
     9	    - the answer-choice step still on luna;
    10	    - production ignoring the exclusions;
    11	    - the judge stopping at the last article.
