codex
**V4 closes most round-three gaps, but a fresh replacement draw can still change which results count and how much the comparison can spend.** V4 requires six complete draws, yet permits a stopped draw to be replaced on a new ledger without specifying how that fits the six-draw limit, the $270 total, or D431’s same-day rule. [V4 completion rule](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:147) · [V4 spend guards](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:220) · [D431](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:4795)

**Round-three gaps**

- **Incomplete draws:** resolved for the original six. Partial results go to Alex as diagnostics. **Ledger authority:** the replacement is explicit in the design. Record it before launch as required. **Absolute stop:** resolved by the per-draw guards. [Completion](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:147) · [Ledger change](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:223) · [Monitoring](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:295)
- **Exposure and blind mapping:** resolved. The exemption requires documented production use, and readers get randomly labelled libraries. **Guardrail denominator:** decided-only is restored. The plan still needs to distinguish disagreements resolved in the two countings from marks that stay “cannot tell” and leave the denominator. That distinction can change whether a subgroup reaches ten cards. [Exposure](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:69) · [Mapping](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:111) · [Guardrails](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:127)
- **Same question and duplicates:** the identity rule is defined, but duplicates still count toward the 30-question minimum. Under v4, 29 different questions plus one repeated bet under another ID clears it. Count the bet once for the minimum and retain the duplicate in the worth guardrail. **Step 2:** thresholds are restored. Specify that a check without enough eligible cases remains unmeasured and cannot clear release. [Identity](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:117) · [D665 minimum](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/clean-arch/PRD.md:145) · [Step 2 checks](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v4.md:189)

**NOT READY: keep any fresh replacement outside the original verdict unless its eligibility, timing and spend are agreed before launch. Freeze the treatment of unresolved marks, duplicates in the minimum, and unmeasured Step 2 checks.**
